al saturated by stirring at 250 rpm for 24 h. The complex was dissolved in a mixture with equal volumes of pre-saturated n-octanol and water to a final concentration of 0.5 mM. The mixture was shaken at 250 rpm for 24 h at 37 °C and then centrifuged at 3000 rpm for 10 min. The complex concentration (C) in each phase was measured by UV-Vis spectroscopy and used to calculate Log p, according to the formula Log p = log (Coctanol/Cwater)."}]}